01:14.960 --> 01:21.360
Trident and then Invicta for the year after. This is an open secret. I mean, it was so funny

01:21.560 --> 01:29.720
before even F3 started. Yeah, for 2027, you know, he's already signed a pre-contract.

01:29.720 --> 01:36.040
